# grooveeq.part -- The groove of test/groove.part, its rounds all of 0.3
# Copyright (c) 2026 Jakob Kastelic

# The floor, the lip and the groove of test/groove.part, with the rounds
# of the inner corners of the groove end of 0.3 too: at the top of each
# corner a convex round meets a concave one of its radius, and the
# concave one goes first, so that the convex one runs round it as round
# a greater one.
profile sp along y 0 -10 0 40 -10 0 40 0 0 0 0 0
extrude slab from -5 to 30 sp
profile lp along y 0 0 0 40 0 0 40 5 0 0 5 0
extrude lip from -5 to 0 lp
union body slab lip
profile gp along y 15 -5 0 25 -5 0 25 1 0 15 1 0
extrude groove from 35 to 0 gp draft 1.5
subtract part body groove
round 0.3 lip.end groove
round 0.3 groove slab
round 0.3 slab.end any
